    <section-starting-page>
        <title>Kotlinmailer Documentation</title>
        <description>
            Kotlinmailer is a Kotlin Multiplatform Email API – coroutine-based, easy to use, and modern!
            You can use it for both clientside and serverside projects,
            meaning you can write once and send emails from everywhere:
            via SMTP on the JVM, Android, Node.js and Apple platforms, or via JMAP on every Kotlin target,
            including the browser.
        </description>
